---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { X_URL } from '../config';
---
<Base title="Sponsor" description="Put your project in front of the people watching Chainlink CCIP live.">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Sponsor ccip.dev</h1>
    <p>ccip.dev is read by LINK holders, builders and analysts who follow Chainlink CCIP every day. One sponsor at a time appears in three places:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Home page card:</strong> directly below the live Constellation.</li>
      <li><strong>Footer line:</strong> on every page.</li>
      <li><strong>Share cards:</strong> a "Sponsored by" line on every card shared to X, Telegram and Discord.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Sponsorships are clearly labeled "Sponsor" and never change the data.</p>
    <p>To ask about availability and pricing, send a DM to <a href={X_URL}>@ccipdev on X</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
